1. ReplayAction.java:207-214 - HTTP form input source (req.getSubmittedForm() + form.getString("mainScript")) feeding user-controlled Groovy to execution pipeline
2. ReplayAction.java:257 - ReplayFlowFactoryAction instantiation with user-controlled script content
